        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.744,
            0.065,
            0.834,
            0.081
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Symmetry"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.12,
            0.834,
            0.21
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For the windmill, the angles of symmetry are "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (quarter turn), "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 8 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (half turn), "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 7 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (three-quarter turn) and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (full turn). Observe that when any figure is rotated by "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , it comes back to its original position, so "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is always an angle of symmetry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.212,
            0.75,
            0.233
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Thus, we see that the windmill has 4 angles of symmetry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.234,
            0.834,
            0.278
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you know of any other shape that has exactly four angles of symmetry?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.28,
            0.833,
            0.324
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How many angles of symmetry does a square have? How much rotation does it require to get the initial square?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.325,
            0.835,
            0.416
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We get back a square overlapping with itself after "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of rotation. This takes point A to the position of point B, point B to the position of point C, point C to the position of point D, and point D back to the position of point A. Do you know where to mark the centre of rotation?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.421,
            0.765,
            0.624
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.209,
                0.421,
                0.765,
                0.624
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_14_image_7.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.643,
            0.545,
            0.664
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What are the other angles of symmetry?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 9,
